   "title": "A Busy Weekend",
   "en": "Last weekend was very busy but full of fun. On Saturday morning, I went to the library with my father. We borrowed four storybooks and read quietly in the corner. In the afternoon, I had a piano lesson for one hour. My teacher said I played a little better than last time. On Sunday, my family visited my grandparents in the countryside. We had lunch together and picked fresh apples in their garden. In the evening, I wrote a short diary about the weekend. Two busy days passed quickly, but I felt very happy and learned a great deal from them.",
   "zh": "上周末非常忙碌，但充满了乐趣。周六上午，我和爸爸去了图书馆。我们借了四本故事书，在角落里安静地阅读。下午我上了一节一小时的钢琴课，老师说我比上次弹得好一点。周日，我们全家去乡下的爷爷奶奶家。我们一起吃午饭，在他们的果园里摘新鲜的苹果。晚上，我写了一段关于周末的短日记。忙碌的两天过得很快，但我感到开心，也学到了很多。",
