   "title": "My Favourite Room",
   "en": "My favourite room at home is my small bedroom. It is not very big, but it is full of my favourite things. Near the window, there is a wooden desk where I do my homework every evening. A small bookshelf stands next to the desk, and it holds all my storybooks and picture books. On the wall, I put a world map and some family photos. My soft toy bear sits on the bed and watches me read. At night, a warm yellow lamp makes the room feel cosy. When I close the door, my room becomes a quiet, happy place of my own.",
   "zh": "在家里，我最喜欢的小房间就是我的卧室。它不大，但装满了我喜欢的东西。窗边有一张木书桌，我每天晚上在那里写作业。书桌旁立着一个小书架，上面放着我的故事书和图画书。墙上贴着一张世界地图和一些全家福照片。我的毛绒玩具熊坐在床上，看着我读书。晚上，一盏温暖的黄色台灯让房间变得温馨。关上房门，我的房间就成了属于我的安静、快乐的小天地。",
