   "title": "Doing Homework",
   "en": "I always start my homework at four thirty in the afternoon. First, I put my books in order and open my notebook. I do the maths problems carefully, then read an English story aloud. Sometimes I ask my mother to help me with difficult words. After that, I write a short Chinese paragraph about my day. My mother says a tidy notebook shows a tidy mind. I try my best to finish all the work before dinner. When I put my pencil down, I feel tired but also very pleased. Doing homework every day helps me learn new things and build good habits.",
   "zh": "我每天下午四点半开始做作业。我先把课本摆好，再打开笔记本。我认真地做数学题，然后朗读一篇英语小故事。有时遇到难词，我会请妈妈帮忙。之后，我用中文写一段关于今天的小短文。妈妈说，整洁的笔记本反映整洁的思维。我会尽力在晚饭前完成所有作业。放下铅笔时，我虽然有些累，但也很开心。每天做作业能让我学到新东西，养成好习惯。",
