   "title": "A Rainy Day",
   "en": "Last Tuesday, it rained all day in our city. I woke up to the sound of raindrops on the window. The sky was grey and the streets were wet. My mother told me to take an umbrella and wear my yellow raincoat. At school, many puddles formed on the playground. After lunch, the rain stopped and a bright rainbow appeared in the sky. All my classmates ran to the window to see it. My teacher said rain helps the flowers and trees grow. I love rainy days because they wash the city clean and bring beautiful rainbows after the storm.",
   "zh": "上周二，我们城市下了一整天的雨。我在雨点敲打窗户的声音中醒来，天空灰蒙蒙的，街道湿漉漉的。妈妈让我带上雨伞，穿上黄色雨衣。到了学校，操场上积起了许多小水坑。午饭后，雨停了，天空中出现了一道明亮的彩虹。所有同学都跑到窗前去看。老师说雨水能帮助花草树木生长。我喜欢下雨天，因为它们把城市冲洗干净，并在风雨后带来美丽的彩虹。",
