   "title": "My Neighbourhood",
   "en": "I live in a friendly neighbourhood with many kind people. Across the street, there is a small park with tall trees and colourful flowers. Every morning, I see old people doing tai chi there. On the corner, there is a fruit shop owned by Uncle Wang. He always gives me a free apple when I pass by. Next to it, a small library opens every weekend, and I love to read there on Sunday afternoons. My neighbourhood feels safe and warm. I know almost everyone, and they all know me. Living in such a nice place makes me feel lucky every day.",
   "zh": "我住在一个友好的社区里，周围有许多善良的人。街对面有一个小公园，里面有高大的树木和五颜六色的花朵。每天早上，我都能看到老人在那里打太极拳。街角是王叔叔开的水果店，每次我路过，他都会送我一只免费的苹果。旁边还有一家小图书馆，每周末开放，我喜欢周日下午去那里看书。我的社区既安全又温暖。我几乎认识每个人，他们也认识我。住在这样一个美好的地方，让我每天都感到幸运。",
