   "title": "Watching the Sunset",
   "en": "Yesterday evening, my father took me to the riverbank to watch the sunset. The sky slowly turned from blue to orange, then to a soft pink. The sun looked like a big red ball, sinking behind the tall buildings. The water of the river shone like gold, and small boats moved quietly across it. Many people stood on the bridge and took photos with their phones. My father told me that no two sunsets are the same. I held his hand and felt very peaceful. When the sun finally disappeared, the city lights began to shine. I will remember that beautiful evening for a long time.",
   "zh": "昨晚，爸爸带我去河边看日落。天空慢慢由蓝色变成橙色，再变成柔和的粉色。太阳像一个巨大的红球，慢慢沉到高楼后面。河面闪着金光，几只小船静静地划过。许多人站在桥上用手机拍照。爸爸告诉我，没有两次日落是完全相同的。我牵着他的手，感到非常平静。当太阳最终消失时，城市的灯光开始亮起。我会久久地记住那个美丽的傍晚。",
