   "title": "My Morning Walk",
   "en": "Every Sunday morning, my grandfather and I go for a walk in the park. We leave home at six thirty, when the air is cool and quiet. The path is lined with green trees, and small birds sing in the branches. My grandfather walks slowly, but I always run ahead and wait for him at the bench. We sometimes see other old people walking their dogs or doing morning exercises. After the walk, we stop at a small shop and buy two hot soy milk drinks. Walking together makes us both healthier and happier. It is my favourite time of the week.",
   "zh": "每个周日上午，我和爷爷都会去公园散步。我们六点半出门，那时空气凉爽而安静。小路两旁是绿色的树木，小鸟在枝头歌唱。爷爷走得很慢，但我总是跑到前面，在长椅旁等他。我们有时会看到其他老人遛狗或做早操。散步后，我们在一家小店停下来，买两杯热豆浆一起喝。一同散步让我们俩都更健康、更快乐。这是我一周中最喜欢的时光。",
