   "title": "A Lost Kitten",
   "en": "Last Friday, I found a small kitten under our car. It was thin, wet, and shaking in the cold rain. I carried it gently into the house and gave it a bowl of warm milk. The kitten drank a little, then fell asleep on a soft towel. My mother helped me make a small bed from a box. We named it Mimi. The next day, we put up a notice near our building, and Mimi's owner came to find her. She was very happy and thanked us many times. I felt sad to say goodbye, but I was glad that Mimi was back home safely.",
   "zh": "上周五，我在我们车底下发现了一只小猫。它又瘦又湿，在冷雨中瑟瑟发抖。我轻轻把它抱进屋里，给了它一碗温牛奶。小猫喝了一点，然后就在一块软毛巾上睡着了。妈妈帮我用纸箱做了一个小窝。我们给它取名“咪咪”。第二天，我们在楼附近贴了一张启事，咪咪的主人来找它了。她非常开心，多次向我们道谢。说再见时我有些难过，但很高兴咪咪平安地回到了家。",
