   "title": "Our School Library",
   "en": "Our school library is my favourite place in the whole school. It is on the second floor, next to the music room. The library has thousands of books, including storybooks, science books, and picture dictionaries. Every Tuesday, my class has a library lesson. Miss Zhao, the librarian, always recommends new books to us. I like to read stories about brave heroes and faraway places. The library is very quiet, so I can think clearly and enjoy my reading. I have a library card and I borrow two books every week. Reading makes me much smarter every day and gives me big dreams for the future.",
   "zh": "我们的学校图书馆是我在学校里最喜欢的地方。它在二楼，紧挨着音乐教室。图书馆里有上千本书，包括故事书、科普书和图画词典。每周二，我们班有一节图书馆课。图书管理员赵老师总会向我们推荐新书。我喜欢读关于勇敢英雄和遥远地方的故事。图书馆非常安静，我可以清楚地思考并享受阅读。我有一张借书证，每周借两本书。阅读让我更聪明，也给了我远大的梦想。",
