   "title": "My English Teacher",
   "en": "My English teacher, Mr Brown, is a tall man with a warm smile. He comes from Canada and has taught English for fifteen years. In his class, we do many fun activities, such as singing English songs, playing word games, and acting out short stories. He always corrects our pronunciation in a kind way. After class, he likes to chat with us about different countries and cultures. He once brought a small world flag collection to show us. Thanks to Mr Brown, I now love learning English. I want to travel around the world one day and speak English with people from many places.",
   "zh": "我的英语老师布朗先生是一位身材高大、笑容温暖的老师。他来自加拿大，已经教了十五年英语。在他的课上，我们做许多有趣的活动，比如唱英文歌、玩单词游戏和表演短剧。他总是用温和的方式纠正我们的发音。下课后，他喜欢和我们聊不同的国家和文化。有一次他带来了一小套世界国旗给我们看。因为布朗先生，我现在非常喜欢学英语。我希望有一天能环游世界，用英语和各地的人们交流。",
