   "title": "Sports Day",
   "en": "Last month, our school held its annual Sports Day. All the students wore their team colours and gathered on the big playground. There were many exciting events, such as the 100-metre race, the long jump, the relay race, and the tug of war. I joined the 100-metre race and came in third in my class. My best friend Lily won first place in the long jump. The most exciting moment was the relay race between Class Three and Class Five. Everyone cheered loudly for their team. In the afternoon, we received small medals and cold drinks. Sports Day was tiring, but I felt very happy and proud.",
   "zh": "上个月，我们学校举办了年度运动会。所有学生都穿着本队颜色的衣服，聚集在大操场上。比赛项目很多，比如百米赛跑、跳远、接力赛和拔河。我参加了百米赛跑，在班里得了第三名。我最好的朋友莉莉在跳远比赛中拿了第一名。最激动人心的时刻是三班和五班之间的接力赛。大家都为自己的班级大声加油。下午，我们领到了小奖牌和冷饮。运动会虽然累，但我感到非常开心和自豪。",
