   "title": "My New Pencil Case",
   "en": "Last weekend, my mother bought me a new pencil case as a gift for doing well in my studies. It is light blue with a picture of a small rabbit on the front. Inside, there are three layers with many pockets. I put my favourite pens, pencils, a small ruler, an eraser, and a sharpener in it. There is also a special place for my name card. I love my new pencil case very much because it is useful and pretty. Every day I take good care of it and never leave it on the floor. A good pencil case makes studying feel more fun and organised.",
   "zh": "上周末，妈妈给我买了一个新笔袋，作为我学习进步的礼物。它是浅蓝色的，正面有一只小兔子的图案。里面有三层和许多小口袋。我把我最喜欢的钢笔、铅笔、一把小尺子、一块橡皮和一个卷笔刀放进去。还有一个专门放我名字卡的位置。我非常喜欢我的新笔袋，因为它既实用又漂亮。每天我都细心爱护它，从不把它丢在地上。一个好的笔袋让学习变得更有趣、更有条理。",
