   "title": "A Family Picnic",
   "en": "Last Sunday, our family had a picnic in a park by the lake. We left home early in the morning and drove for about an hour. The weather was perfect, with a clear blue sky and a soft breeze. My mother prepared sandwiches, fruit salad, and cold juice. My father set up a small table and chairs, while my sister and I flew a colourful kite. After lunch, we went for a walk along the lake and saw many small fish jumping out of the water. In the afternoon, we played card games on the picnic mat. It was a simple but wonderful day. I love spending time with my family.",
   "zh": "上周日，我们全家在湖边的公园野餐。我们一大早就出发了，开了大约一小时的车。天气很好，天空湛蓝，微风轻拂。妈妈准备了三明治、水果沙拉和冷果汁。爸爸支起了一张小桌子和椅子，我和妹妹则放飞了一只彩色风筝。午饭后，我们沿着湖边散步，看到许多小鱼跳出水面。下午，我们在野餐垫上玩纸牌游戏。这是简单却美好的一天。我喜欢和家人共度时光。",
