   "title": "Playing Football",
   "en": "Every Saturday afternoon, I play football with my friends in the park. We have a small team of seven players. I am the goalkeeper, and my job is to stop the ball from going into the net. At first, I was not very good at it. The ball often went past me, and I felt sad. But my coach and friends encouraged me to keep trying. I practised catching and diving at home. Slowly, I got better. Last week, I saved three goals in one match, and my team won. We all cheered together. Football is fun, and it teaches me to be brave and to work with others.",
   "zh": "每周六下午，我和朋友们在公园踢足球。我们有一个七人小队。我是守门员，职责是把球挡在网外。一开始我不太擅长，球经常从我身边飞过，我很难过。但教练和朋友们鼓励我继续努力。我在家练习接球和扑救。慢慢地，我进步了。上周，我在比赛中扑出了三个球，我们队赢了。我们一起欢呼。足球很有趣，它教会我勇敢和团队合作。",
