   "title": "Caring for Our Hamster",
   "en": "My little brother Leo has a small hamster named Coco. Coco is brown and white, with two big black eyes. She lives in a clear plastic cage with a wheel, a small house, and a water bottle. Every day, Leo and I clean the cage and give Coco fresh food and water. We also let her run in a small ball around the living room. Hamsters sleep during the day and run on the wheel at night, so we hear funny little sounds sometimes. Taking care of Coco has taught Leo how to be gentle and responsible. We all love her very much.",
   "zh": "我的小弟弟利奥有一只小仓鼠，名叫“可可”。可可是棕白相间的，有两只黑色的大眼睛。她住在一个透明的塑料笼子里，笼子里有转轮、小房子和水壶。每天，我和利奥都会清理笼子，给可可新鲜的食物和水。我们还让她在客厅里的小球里跑一跑。仓鼠白天睡觉，晚上在转轮上跑，所以有时我们会听到有趣的小声音。照顾可可教会了利奥如何温柔和有责任感。我们都非常爱她。",
