   "title": "Healthy Fruits (102)",
   "en": "When I think of a happy day, I almost always remember what we ate, and who was sitting around the table. Cooking is not difficult; it only asks you to pay attention, and paying attention is a useful habit everywhere. My father makes egg fried rice with yesterday's rice, and it always tastes better than the fresh kind, which makes no sense to me. Nobody said much for a moment, and then everybody started to laugh. In summer we eat cold noodles with cucumber and vinegar, and the whole family makes a happy noise while eating. Once I tried to cook noodles alone and put in three times too much salt, and we ended up eating bread for dinner. One afternoon I sat still for ten minutes and simply watched, and I noticed three things I had walked past a hundred times. At that moment I felt warm and a little shy, and I did not know where to put my hands. I learned that being brave does not mean you are not afraid; it means you go on even when you are. So now, whenever the same chance comes again, I will not wait so long before I say yes.",
   "zh": "想起快乐的一天，我几乎总记得我们吃了什么，谁坐在桌边。做饭不难，它只要求你用心，而用心在任何地方都是好习惯。爸爸用隔夜饭做蛋炒饭，总比新米饭做的好吃，我怎么也想不通。有一小会儿谁也没说话，然后大家都笑了起来。夏天我们吃黄瓜醋凉面，全家吃得心满意足、响声不断。有一次我自己煮面，盐放了整整三倍，结果我们晚饭吃的是面包。有一天下午我坐着不动看了十分钟，发现了三样走过一百次都没注意的东西。那一刻我又暖又有点不好意思，不知道手该往哪儿放。我学到了：勇敢不是不害怕，而是害怕的时候仍然往前走。所以下次同样的机会来时，我不会再犹豫那么久才答应。",
