   "title": "Healthy Fruits (103)",
   "en": "Food is more than something we eat; in my family it is the way we say good morning, welcome home and I love you. At the market the vegetable sellers call out their prices, and my mother walks slowly, touching every tomato before choosing. In summer we eat cold noodles with cucumber and vinegar, and the whole family makes a happy noise while eating. I keep that day in my mind because nothing about it was special, and that is why I like it. Once I tried to cook noodles alone and put in three times too much salt, and we ended up eating bread for dinner. Cooking is not difficult; it only asks you to pay attention, and paying attention is a useful habit everywhere. One afternoon I sat still for ten minutes and simply watched, and I noticed three things I had walked past a hundred times. At that moment I felt warm and a little shy, and I did not know where to put my hands. I learned that being brave does not mean you are not afraid; it means you go on even when you are. So now, whenever the same chance comes again, I will not wait so long before I say yes.",
   "zh": "食物不只是吃的东西；在我家，它是我们说早安、欢迎回家和我爱你的方式。菜市场里摊主吆喝着价钱，妈妈慢慢走，每个番茄都要摸一摸才挑。夏天我们吃黄瓜醋凉面，全家吃得心满意足、响声不断。我一直记着那一天，因为它没有什么特别之处，而这正是我喜欢它的原因。有一次我自己煮面，盐放了整整三倍，结果我们晚饭吃的是面包。做饭不难，它只要求你用心，而用心在任何地方都是好习惯。有一天下午我坐着不动看了十分钟，发现了三样走过一百次都没注意的东西。那一刻我又暖又有点不好意思，不知道手该往哪儿放。我学到了：勇敢不是不害怕，而是害怕的时候仍然往前走。所以下次同样的机会来时，我不会再犹豫那么久才答应。",
