   "title": "Snakes",
   "titleZh": "",
   "en": "Today I read a book about snakes. I found some interesting facts, especially some surprising facts in it. Did you know that some big snakes are strong enough to kill a pig or a goat? All snakes eat animals. Without snakes the world would probably be filled with rats and mice.\nYou probably didn't know that snakes smell with their noses and their tongues. Some snakes are even longer than an elephant or a giraffe! This book made me think a lot about snakes. Most snakes don't hurt people, but some are dangerous. I'm thinking if I saw a snake, would I know if it was dangerous?",
   "zh": "今天我读了一本关于蛇的书。我发现其中有一些有趣的事实，尤其是一些令人吃惊的事实。你知道吗？一些大蛇很强壮足以杀死一头猪或一只山羊。所有的蛇都吃动物。如果没有蛇，这个世界很可能充满了(be你很可能不知道蛇是用它们的鼻子和舌头来闻气味的。有的蛇甚至比一头象或一只长颈鹿这本书让我想了很多关于蛇的事情。大部分蛇不伤害人，但有些是危险的蛇。我在想如果我看到一只蛇，我是否会知道它是危险的？",
