   "title": "Beijing Zoo",
   "titleZh": "",
   "en": "Beijing Zoo has many animals such as the giant panda and the golden monkey, and also has the animals from all over the world—— elephant, camel, giraffe, tiger, lion, zebra, etc. Beijing Zoo covers an area of more than 50,000 square meters and there are more than 30 large halls. It is also a famous center of zoological research. Recently a new form of ticketing has been introduced at Beijing Zoo——a CD-like ticket. There is music and video of the animals in the CD. You can read it through your computer or VCD player. There is also an important message on the CD: we should all help protect the environment where we live.",
   "zh": "北京动物园有很多动物，如大熊猫和金丝猴，也有许多来自世界各地的动物——大象、骆驼、长颈鹿、老虎、狮子、斑马北京动物园占地50000平方米，有30多(巨大的)个场馆。北京动物园也是著名的动物学研究中心( 最近，北京动物园引进一种新形式的票——一种光盘式的票。光盘里面有音乐和这些动物的视频。你可以通过电脑或影碟播放器来阅读这些信息。这张光盘里还有一条重要短信：我们都应该保护我们的居住环境",
