   "title": "Strawberry and Watermelon Juice",
   "titleZh": "",
   "en": "Finding pleasant ways to eat more fruit is one of the secrets of losing weight successfully. Because strawberry and watermelon taste very good when put together, this strawberry and watermelon juice is a great way to help us to achieve the purpose of losing weight.\nThis juice is lovely served for breakfast with our, strawberry and orange pancakes. Put 1 2 cup of strawberries and 2 cups of watermelon together, and serve immediately in your favorite glass.",
   "zh": "找到吃更多水果的快乐方式是成功减肥的一个秘诀。因为草莓和西瓜放在一起时味道很好，这个草莓西瓜果汁是帮助我们实现减肥目标的好方式。这种果汁配上草莓和橘子薄饼，那可是一顿美味的早餐了。放入1/2杯的草莓和2杯西瓜搅拌，装入你最喜欢的玻璃杯里，就立刻端上来吧。",
