   "title": "Coke",
   "titleZh": "",
   "en": "If you have too much coke, sugar, and chocolate, you'll be easily getting fat. Now I'd like to talk about coke. Coke is a soft drink. It has many advantages but on the other hand many disadvantages which lead to health problems. There are plenty of sugar added to give the coke more taste and energy and while energy can be good, too much of it can increase health risks. But it looks as if coke will still remain number one when it comes to soft drinks but please remember that if you have health problems then do not drink it, if not, coke still remains a favorite, and drink it sometimes!",
   "zh": "如果你喝太多可乐、食用太多糖和巧克力，你会很容易发胖。现在我想谈谈可乐。可乐是一种软饮料。它有很多好处，但另一方面也有很多不利之处，可以导致健康问题。可乐里添加了相当多的糖让可乐味道更好并提供更多能量，虽然能量是好的，但过多会增加健康风险。但说到软饮料，看起来好像可乐仍是排名第一，但请记住如果你有健?康问题，那么不要喝它，如果没有，可乐仍可作为喜爱之物，可以偶尔饮之。",
